{"title": "Rare Herb Subtable", "pageid": 16893, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rare_Herb_Subtable", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Leveled drop tables", "Alchemy drop tables", "Subtables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Rare Herb Table</b>, also known as <code>ST_Alchemy_Herb_Rare</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_Alchemy_Herb_Rare+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_Alchemy_Herb_Rare+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> that contains rare herb-like alchemical ingredients.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Rare Herb Subtable}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Up to level 5</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balsam\" title=\"Balsam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Balsam_Item_Icon.png/40px-Balsam_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Balsam_Item_Icon.png/60px-Balsam_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/09/Balsam_Item_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Balsam_Item_Icon.png/40px-Balsam_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Balsam_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Balsam\" title=\"Balsam\">Balsam</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 6 - 8</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weavemoss\" title=\"Weavemoss\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Weavemoss_Item_Icon.png/40px-Weavemoss_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Weavemoss_Item_Icon.png/60px-Weavemoss_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d5/Weavemoss_Item_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Weavemoss_Item_Icon.png/40px-Weavemoss_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Weavemoss_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Weavemoss\" title=\"Weavemoss\">Weavemoss</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/2</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals\" title=\"Yellow Musk Creeper Petals\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png/40px-Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Ico